#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:275 includes/class-edta-admin.php:301
#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:451
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Clair"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Light/dark mode for Astra with a toggle button (floating, widget, shortcode) "
"and palette mapping to Astra Global Colors."
msgstr ""
"Mode clair/sombre pour Astra avec un bouton de basculement (flottant, widget,"
" shortcode) et mappage de palette aux couleurs globales Astra."

#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:29
msgid ""
"Loads a previously exported JSON file and applies that configuration on this "
"site."
msgstr ""
"Charge un fichier JSON exporté précédemment et applique cette configuration "
"sur ce site."

#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:27
msgid ""
"Maps your palette to Astra variables (--ast-global-color-0..8). This affects "
"the theme design when the mode changes."
msgstr ""
"Associe votre palette aux variables Astra (--ast-global-color-0..8). Cela "
"affecte le design du thème lors du changement de mode."

#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:300
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:185 includes/class-edta-admin.php:662
msgid "No changes"
msgstr "Aucune modification"

#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:241 includes/class-edta-admin.php:243
msgid "Not authorized."
msgstr "Non autorisé."

#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:19
msgid ""
"Only applies when Control Mode is set to Auto. Lets you force Light or Dark, "
"or follow the system preference."
msgstr ""
"S'applique uniquement quand le Mode de contrôle est sur Auto. Permet de "
"forcer Clair ou Sombre, ou de suivre la préférence système."

#: includes/class-edta-admin.php:31
msgid ""
"Options to improve accessibility (reduced-motion support, visible focus, etc."
"). Recommended to keep enabled."
msgstr ""
"Options pour améliorer l'accessibilité (support du mouvement réduit, focus "
"visible, etc.). Recommandé de les garder activées."

